## 46. ISO/IEC 27701

ISO/IEC 27701 provides a privacy information management framework that extends information security management concepts toward privacy management.

It can support:

- Privacy governance
- Personal-data processing management
- Privacy risk management
- Accountability
- Roles and responsibilities
- Control implementation
- Continuous improvement

ISO/IEC 27701 can be used alongside ISO/IEC 27001 within an integrated management-system approach.

---

## 47. NIST Privacy Framework

The NIST Privacy Framework provides a risk-based approach to managing privacy risks.

Its structure includes:

- Identify-P
- Govern-P
- Control-P
- Communicate-P
- Protect-P

The framework can help organizations connect privacy outcomes with organizational risk management and cybersecurity activities.

